[For "black"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "caro-exchange 6...e6"]
[Name "Exchange: 7.Bg5"]

7. Bg5 { White pins the knight in turn, and the pawn on d4 is looked after by the queen for now. }
7... Nc6 { Develops and hits d4: the usual plan needs no change. [%cal Gc6d4] }
8. O-O Be7 { Unpins and develops. Black castles next. } *
